<!DOCTYPE html>
<!-- @dsCard group="Brand" name="Deep Ocean Landing Page Desktop" subtitle="Bold dark hero, live feed preview window, filter-rail listings" viewport="1280x2400" -->
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>RemoteJobs44 — Deep Ocean Landing Page Desktop</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="colors_and_type.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="components.css">
<style>
  /* ============ Direction B — Deep Ocean Live ============ */
  /* Hero now follows the theme: white in light mode, deep navy in dark. */
  .hero-b {
    position: relative; overflow: hidden; color: var(--fg-1);
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 64% 54% at 16% 8%, rgba(37,99,235,0.12), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 52% 60% at 94% 84%, rgba(249,115,22,0.08), transparent 60%),
      linear-gradient(102deg, rgba(238,241,246,0.97) 0%, rgba(238,241,246,0.93) 42%, rgba(238,241,246,0.74) 100%),
      url(assets/hero-videocall-sm.jpg) center 22%/cover no-repeat,
      var(--bg-app);
    padding: 26px 0 92px;
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .hero-b {
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 18% 12%, rgba(37,99,235,0.32), transparent 62%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 60% at 92% 80%, rgba(249,115,22,0.16), transparent 60%),
      linear-gradient(102deg, rgba(8,18,36,0.94) 0%, rgba(9,20,38,0.82) 44%, rgba(10,22,40,0.54) 100%),
      url(assets/hero-videocall-sm.jpg) center 22%/cover no-repeat,
      #060e1f;
  }
  .hero-b::after {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: 0.6; pointer-events: none;
    background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(37,99,235,0.08) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 26px 26px; mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, #000, transparent 70%);
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .hero-b::after { opacity: 0.5; background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.07) 1px, transparent 1px); }
  .hero-b .header-inner { height: 70px; }
  .hero-b .hb-body { position: relative; z-index: 2; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: start; padding-top: 40px; }
  .hero-b .hb-copy { max-width: 680px; }
  .hb-auth { display: none; }

  .hero-b .eyebrow-pill { background: rgba(37,99,235,0.08); border-color: rgba(37,99,235,0.22); color: var(--brand-600); }
  [data-theme="dark"] .hero-b .eyebrow-pill { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.16); color: #dbeafe; }
  .hero-b h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.035em; color: var(--fg-1);
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4.4rem); line-height: 0.98; margin: 20px 0 18px; text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .hero-b h1 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--brand-700); }
  [data-theme="dark"] .hero-b h1 { color: #fff; }
  [data-theme="dark"] .hero-b h1 em { color: var(--accent-light); }
  .hero-b .lede { color: var(--fg-2); font-size: var(--fs-lg); line-height: 1.5; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 0 28px; }
  .hero-b .lede b { color: var(--fg-1); font-weight: 700; }
  [data-theme="dark"] .hero-b .lede { color: #aebfd6; }
  [data-theme="dark"] .hero-b .lede b { color: #fff; }

  .hb-search {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; max-width: 540px;
    background: var(--bg-card); border: 1.5px solid var(--border-2); border-radius: 18px; padding: 8px 8px 8px 18px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg-brand);
  }
  .hb-search:focus-within { border-color: var(--brand-500); }
  [data-theme="dark"] .hb-search { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.97); border-color: transparent; box-shadow: 0 24px 60px -18px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); }
  .hb-search .s-icon { width: 22px; height: 22px; color: var(--fg-4); }
  .hb-search input { flex: 1; border: none; outline: none; background: transparent; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 17px; color: var(--fg-1); min-width: 0; }
  [data-theme="dark"] .hb-search input { color: #0f172a; }
  .hb-search input::placeholder { color: var(--fg-4); }
  .hb-search .btn { border-radius: 13px; }
  .hb-chips { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 16px; }
  .hb-chips .lbl { font-size: 13px; color: var(--fg-4); }
  .hb-chip { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; padding: 6px 13px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--bg-card); border: 1.5px solid var(--border-2); color: var(--fg-2); cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; transition: all var(--dur-fast); }
  .hb-chip:hover { border-color: var(--brand-500); color: var(--brand-700); background: var(--brand-50); }
  [data-theme="dark"] .hb-chip { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.14); color: #cdd9ec; }
  [data-theme="dark"] .hb-chip:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.14); color: #fff; }

  .hb-stats { display: flex; gap: 40px; margin-top: 36px; }
  .hb-stat .n { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 30px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--fg-1); }
  .hb-stat .l { font-size: 13px; color: var(--fg-3); margin-top: 2px; }
  [data-theme="dark"] .hb-stat .n { color: #fff; }
  [data-theme="dark"] .hb-stat .l { color: #8ea2c2; }

  /* Live preview window */
  .preview {
    background: var(--bg-card); border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl-brand); border: 1.5px solid var(--border-1);
    transform: rotate(0.6deg);
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .preview { box-shadow: 0 40px 90px -30px rgba(0,0,0,0.7); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }

  /* Floating member photo overlapping the preview window */
  .preview-wrap { position: relative; }
  .hero-photo {
    position: absolute; left: -46px; bottom: -36px; width: 172px; margin: 0; z-index: 3;
    border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 5px solid var(--bg-app); box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl-brand);
  }
  .hero-photo img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 204px; object-fit: cover; }
  .hero-photo figcaption {
    position: absolute; left: 9px; right: 9px; bottom: 9px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
    font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff;
    background: rgba(10,22,40,0.6); backdrop-filter: blur(6px); padding: 7px 10px; border-radius: 11px;
  }
  .hp-pulse { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #22c55e; flex-shrink: 0; animation: pulse 2s infinite; }
  .preview-bar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 13px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-1); background: var(--bg-section); }
  .preview-bar .dots { display: flex; gap: 6px; }
  .preview-bar .dots i { width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 50%; display: block; }
  .preview-url { flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--fg-3); font-family: var(--font-mono); }
  .preview-url .live { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; color: var(--success); font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 600; }
  .preview-url .live i { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--success); animation: pulse 2s infinite; }
  .preview-search { padding: 14px 16px 6px; }
  .preview-search .pbox { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; background: var(--bg-section); border: 1.5px solid var(--border-2); border-radius: 11px; padding: 9px 13px; }
  .preview-search .pbox svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; color: var(--fg-4); }
  .preview-search .pbox span { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--fg-4); }
  .preview-viewport { height: 296px; overflow: hidden; position: relative; -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, #000 8%, #000 88%, transparent); mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, #000 8%, #000 88%, transparent); }
  .preview-track { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px; padding: 10px 16px; animation: scrollfeed 22s linear infinite; }
  .preview:hover .preview-track { animation-play-state: paused; }
  @keyframes scrollfeed { from { transform: translateY(0); } to { transform: translateY(-50%); } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .preview-track { animation: none; } }
  .prow { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr auto; gap: 12px; align-items: center; padding: 11px 13px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1.5px solid var(--border-1); background: var(--bg-card); }
  .prow .job-logo { width: 40px; height: 40px; font-size: 13px; border-radius: 11px; }
  .prow .pt { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: var(--fg-1); }
  .prow .pm { font-size: 12px; color: var(--fg-3); }
  .prow .pp { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; color: var(--success); white-space: nowrap; }

  /* Sections */
  .band { padding: 36px 0 20px; background: var(--bg-app); }
  .band-label { text-align: center; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--fg-4); margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .sec { padding: 76px 0; }
  .sec--tint { background: var(--bg-section); }

  .listing-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 248px 1fr; gap: 32px; align-items: start; }
  .filter-rail { position: sticky; top: 90px; background: var(--bg-card); border: 1.5px solid var(--border-1); border-radius: 18px; padding: 22px; }
  .filter-rail h4 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--fg-1); margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .fgroup { padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-3); }
  .fgroup:first-of-type { border-top: none; padding-top: 0; }
  .fgroup .ft { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--fg-4); margin-bottom: 11px; }
  .fopt { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 6px 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--fg-2); cursor: pointer; }
  .fopt .box { width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1.5px solid var(--border-2); flex-shrink: 0; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: all var(--dur-fast); }
  .fopt .box svg { width: 12px; height: 12px; color: #fff; opacity: 0; }
  .fopt.on .box { background: var(--brand-600); border-color: var(--brand-600); }
  .fopt.on .box svg { opacity: 1; }
  .fopt .ct { margin-left: auto; font-size: 12px; color: var(--fg-4); }
  .fopt:hover { color: var(--brand-700); }
  [data-theme="dark"] .fopt:hover { color: var(--brand-400); }

  .listing-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .listing-head .lh-t { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; color: var(--fg-1); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; }
  .listing-head .pulse { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--success); animation: pulse 2s infinite; }
  .listing-search { flex: 1; max-width: 320px; min-width: 220px; }
  .listing-search .search-box { box-shadow: none; padding: 5px 5px 5px 14px; }
  .listing-search input { font-size: 14.5px; }

  .cta-band { padding: 96px 0; position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0c1d3a, #0a1628); }
  .cta-band::before { content:''; position:absolute; inset:0; background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px; mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 60% at 50% 50%, #000, transparent 75%); }
  .cta-inner { position: relative; text-align: center; max-width: 660px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .cta-inner h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); color: #fff; line-height: 1.05; margin: 18px 0 14px; }
  .cta-inner p { color: #aebfd6; font-size: var(--fs-md); margin: 0 0 30px; }
  .cta-inner .eyebrow-pill { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); color: #fff; }
  .cta-actions { display: flex; gap: 14px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }

  /* Mission */
  .mission-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr; gap: 56px; align-items: center; }
  .mission-copy h2 { font-size: var(--fs-2xl); line-height: 1.12; margin: 14px 0 16px; }
  .mission-copy p { font-size: var(--fs-md); color: var(--fg-2); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; max-width: 520px; }
  .mission-copy p b { color: var(--fg-1); }
  .mstat-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; }
  .mstat { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1.5px solid var(--border-1); border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px 22px; }
  .mstat .n { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 30px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--brand-700); }
  [data-theme="dark"] .mstat .n { color: var(--brand-400); }
  .mstat .l { font-size: 13px; color: var(--fg-3); line-height: 1.45; margin-top: 4px; }

  /* How it works */
  .steps-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
  .step { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1.5px solid var(--border-1); border-radius: 18px; padding: 26px; }
  .step .num { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--brand-700); }
  [data-theme="dark"] .step .num { color: var(--brand-400); }
  .step h3 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--fg-1); margin: 10px 0 8px; }
  .step p { font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--fg-2); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0; }
  .step .price-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 14px; }
  .price-pill { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--brand-50); color: var(--brand-700); border: 1px solid var(--brand-200); }
  [data-theme="dark"] .price-pill { background: rgba(59,130,246,0.15); color: var(--brand-400); border-color: rgba(59,130,246,0.3); }

  /* Pricing tiers */
  .price-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; align-items: stretch; }
  .ptier { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: var(--bg-card); border: 1.5px solid var(--border-1); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px 26px; }
  .ptier--pop { border-color: var(--brand-600); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg-brand); }
  [data-theme="dark"] .ptier--pop { border-color: var(--brand-500); }
  .pt-badge { position: absolute; top: -11px; left: 26px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: #fff; background: var(--brand-600); padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; }
  .pt-name { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brand-700); }
  [data-theme="dark"] .pt-name { color: var(--brand-400); }
  .pt-price { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px; margin: 12px 0 4px; }
  .pt-price b { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 42px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--fg-1); line-height: 1; }
  .pt-price span { font-size: 14px; color: var(--fg-3); }
  .pt-tag { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--fg-2); margin: 0 0 20px; }
  .pt-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 11px; }
  .pt-list li { position: relative; padding-left: 28px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--fg-2); line-height: 1.4; }
  .pt-list li::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 1px; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(34,197,94,0.16); }
  .pt-list li::after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 5.5px; top: 6px; width: 6px; height: 3px; border-left: 2px solid var(--success); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--success); transform: rotate(-45deg); }
  .pt-cta { margin-top: auto; width: 100%; justify-content: center; }

  /* Testimonials */
  .tcard-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
  .tcard { display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: var(--bg-card); border: 1.5px solid var(--border-1); border-radius: 18px; padding: 26px; }
  .tcard .quote-mark { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 44px; line-height: 0.7; color: var(--brand-300); }
  [data-theme="dark"] .tcard .quote-mark { color: var(--brand-500); }
  .tcard blockquote { margin: 12px 0 22px; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--fg-1); }
  .tcard blockquote b { color: var(--brand-700); font-weight: 700; }
  [data-theme="dark"] .tcard blockquote b { color: var(--brand-400); }
  .tcard-person { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: auto; }
  .tcard-person img { width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .tcard-person .pn { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--fg-1); }
  .tcard-person .pr { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--fg-3); margin-top: 1px; }
  .tcard-person .stars { margin-left: auto; color: var(--accent); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 1px; }

  /* Categories browse grid */
  .cat-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
  .cat-tile { min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding: 22px; border-radius: 16px; border: 1.5px solid var(--border-1); background: var(--bg-card); text-decoration: none; transition: border-color var(--dur-fast), transform var(--dur-fast); }
  .cat-tile:hover { border-color: var(--brand-400); transform: translateY(-3px); }
  .cat-tile .ci { width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 12px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: var(--cat-bg); color: var(--cat-fg); }
  .cat-tile .ci svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; }
  .cat-tile .cn { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; color: var(--fg-1); }
  .cat-tile .cc { font-size: 13px; color: var(--fg-3); }
  .cat-tile .cc b { color: var(--brand-700); font-weight: 700; }
  [data-theme="dark"] .cat-tile .cc b { color: var(--brand-400); }

  /* FAQ */
  .faq-grid { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .faq { border: 1.5px solid var(--border-1); border-radius: 16px; background: var(--bg-card); overflow: hidden; }
  .faq summary { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; padding: 20px 24px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; color: var(--fg-1); }
  .faq summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .faq summary .pm { width: 22px; height: 22px; flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--brand-600); transition: transform var(--dur-fast); }
  .faq[open] summary .pm { transform: rotate(45deg); }
  .faq p { margin: 0; padding: 0 24px 22px; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--fg-2); }

  /* Castle-style differentiator 3-up with mini UI mocks */
  .diff-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
  .diff-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: var(--bg-card); border: 1.5px solid var(--border-1); border-radius: 20px; padding: 26px; }
  .diff-card .dnum { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--brand-600); }
  [data-theme="dark"] .diff-card .dnum { color: var(--brand-400); }
  .diff-card h3 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--fg-1); margin: 12px 0 8px; }
  .diff-card > p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--fg-2); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 20px; }
  .diff-mock { margin-top: auto; background: var(--bg-section); border: 1.5px solid var(--border-1); border-radius: 14px; padding: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .mock-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--fg-2); }
  .mock-row .tick { width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 6px; background: rgba(34,197,94,0.16); color: var(--success); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .mock-row .tick svg { width: 11px; height: 11px; }
  .mock-row b { color: var(--fg-1); font-weight: 700; }
  .mock-bar { height: 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--border-2); overflow: hidden; }
  .mock-bar i { display: block; height: 100%; border-radius: 999px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--brand-500), var(--accent)); }
  .mock-apply { justify-content: space-between; }
  .mock-apply .mbtn { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; color: #fff; background: var(--brand-600); padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 9px; }

  /* Castle-style capabilities grid */
  .cap-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
  .cap-tile { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1.5px solid var(--border-1); border-radius: 18px; padding: 24px; transition: border-color var(--dur-fast); }
  .cap-tile:hover { border-color: var(--brand-300); }
  .cap-tile .cap-ic { width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--brand-50); color: var(--brand-700); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  [data-theme="dark"] .cap-tile .cap-ic { background: rgba(59,130,246,0.16); color: var(--brand-400); }
  .cap-tile .cap-ic svg { width: 21px; height: 21px; }
  .cap-tile h3 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 16.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--fg-1); margin: 16px 0 6px; }
  .cap-tile p { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--fg-2); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; }

  /* Stat line (Castle developers trio) */
  .statline { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin-top: 34px; padding-top: 30px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-3); }
  .statline .si .n { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--fg-1); }
  [data-theme="dark"] .statline .si .n { color: #fff; }
  .statline .si .l { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--fg-3); line-height: 1.45; margin-top: 5px; max-width: 250px; }

  /* ===== Auxia-inspired live market wall ===== */
  .livewall { position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 88px 0 0; color: #fff;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 50% 0%, rgba(37,99,235,0.30), transparent 60%), linear-gradient(160deg, #0c1d3a, #0a1628 58%, #060e1f); }
  .livewall::before { content:''; position:absolute; inset:0; background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px; mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 50% 30%, #000, transparent 80%); -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 50% 30%, #000, transparent 80%); }
  .lw-head { position: relative; z-index: 2; text-align: center; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
  .lw-kicker { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight:700; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.03em; color:#dbeafe; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18); padding:6px 14px; border-radius:999px; }
  .lw-kicker .lw-dot { width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:50%; background: var(--success); animation: pulse 2s infinite; }
  .livewall h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-0.03em; font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.6vw, 3rem); line-height:1.05; color:#fff; margin:16px 0 12px; }
  .livewall .lw-head p { color:#aebfd6; font-size: var(--fs-md); margin:0; }
  .lw-stage { position: relative; z-index: 2; margin: 46px auto 0; height: 540px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 16px; padding: 0 28px; max-width: 1240px;
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, #000 12%, #000 80%, transparent); mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, #000 12%, #000 80%, transparent); }
  .lw-col { overflow: hidden; }
  .lw-track { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; animation: lwUp 30s linear infinite; }
  .lw-col:nth-child(2) .lw-track { animation: lwDown 38s linear infinite; }
  .lw-col:nth-child(3) .lw-track { animation: lwUp 34s linear infinite; }
  .lw-col:nth-child(4) .lw-track { animation: lwDown 44s linear infinite; }
  .lw-col:hover .lw-track { animation-play-state: paused; }
  @keyframes lwUp { from { transform: translateY(0); } to { transform: translateY(-50%); } }
  @keyframes lwDown { from { transform: translateY(-50%); } to { transform: translateY(0); } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .lw-track { animation: none !important; } }
  .lw-card { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 16px; padding: 16px; }
  .lw-top { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content: space-between; }
  .lw-card .job-logo { width: 36px; height: 36px; font-size: 12px; border-radius: 10px; }
  .lw-pay { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight:700; font-size:13px; color: #6ee7b7; }
  .lw-title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight:700; font-size:15px; color:#fff; margin: 12px 0 3px; }
  .lw-co { font-size: 12.5px; color:#9fb2cf; }
  .lw-foot { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 12px; padding-top:11px; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }
  .lw-live { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; font-size:11.5px; font-weight:600; color: var(--success); }
  .lw-live i { width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; background: var(--success); animation: pulse 2s infinite; }
  .lw-age { font-size:11.5px; color:#7e93b4; }

  /* Hero staggered entrance — base state is the final, visible state; the
     animation runs only once JS adds [data-hero-in] (i.e. the page is live),
     so a backgrounded/hidden render never freezes the hero at opacity:0. */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .hero-b[data-hero-in] .hb-copy > * { animation: heroRise 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1) both; }
    .hb-copy > *:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.05s} .hb-copy > *:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.13s}
    .hb-copy > *:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.21s} .hb-copy > *:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.29s}
    .hb-copy > *:nth-child(5){animation-delay:.37s} .hb-copy > *:nth-child(6){animation-delay:.45s}
    .hero-b[data-hero-in] .preview-wrap { animation: heroRise 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1) 0.3s both; }
    @keyframes heroRise { from { opacity:0; transform: translateY(18px); } to { opacity:1; transform:none; } }
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .hero-b .hb-body { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 44px; }
    .lw-stage { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); height: 480px; }
    .lw-col:nth-child(n+3) { display: none; }
    .mission-grid, .steps-grid, .price-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .tcard-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .diff-grid, .cap-grid, .statline { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cat-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .preview { max-width: 460px; }
    .hero-photo { left: -16px; }
    .listing-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .filter-rail { position: static; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 520px) { .hero-b { padding-bottom: 60px; } .hb-stats { gap: 26px; } .hero-photo { display: none; } .lw-stage { grid-template-columns: 1fr; height: 440px; } .lw-col:nth-child(n+2) { display: none; } }

  /* ---- Mobile alignment & overflow fixes ---- */
  html, body { overflow-x: hidden; }
  .hb-search .btn { white-space: nowrap; }
  .hero-b .hb-body > * { min-width: 0; }
  .hero-b .preview, .hero-b .hb-search { max-width: 100%; }
  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .hero-b .nav { display: none; }
    .preview { transform: none; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero-b h1 { font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.14; margin: 8px 0 10px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
    .hero-b .lede { font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .hero-b .eyebrow-pill { font-size: 11px; }
    .hb-search { padding: 6px 6px 6px 14px; }
    .hb-search input { font-size: 15px; }
    .hb-search .s-icon { width: 18px; height: 18px; }
    .hb-search .btn { font-size: 13px; padding: 9px 14px; }
    .hb-chips { margin-top: 10px; gap: 7px; }
    .hb-chips .lbl, .hb-chip { font-size: 12px; }
    .hb-chip { padding: 5px 11px; }
    .hb-stats { margin-top: 16px; gap: 18px; }
    .hb-auth { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 20px; }
    .hb-auth .btn { flex: 1; justify-content: center; padding: 12px; }
    .hb-stat .n { font-size: 23px; }
    .hb-stat .l { font-size: 12px; }
    .sec { padding: 30px 0; }
    .band { padding: 18px 0 8px; }
    .section-head h2 { font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.14; }
    .section-head p { font-size: 14px; }
    .diff-grid { gap: 12px; }
    .diff-card { padding: 18px; border-radius: 16px; }
    .diff-card .dnum { font-size: 10.5px; }
    .diff-card h3 { font-size: 16px; margin: 9px 0 6px; }
    .diff-card > p { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .diff-mock { padding: 12px; gap: 8px; }
    .mock-row { font-size: 11.5px; gap: 8px; }
    .mock-row .tick { width: 16px; height: 16px; }
    .mock-apply .mbtn { font-size: 11px; padding: 6px 12px; }
    .hero-b .hb-body { gap: 28px; }
    .hero-b { padding-top: 28px; padding-bottom: 30px; }
    .hero-b .hb-body { padding-top: 16px; }
    .livewall { padding: 34px 0; }
    .cta-band { padding: 40px 0; }
    .lw-stage { height: 330px; }
    .preview-bar { padding: 10px 13px; }
    .preview-search { padding: 9px 13px 4px; }
    .preview-search .pbox { padding: 8px 11px; }
    .preview-search .pbox span { font-size: 11.5px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
    .preview-viewport { height: 232px; }
    .hb-chips { flex-wrap: nowrap; overflow-x: auto; scrollbar-width: none; padding-bottom: 2px; }
    .hb-chips::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .hb-chips .lbl, .hb-chip { flex-shrink: 0; white-space: nowrap; }
    .cat-grid { gap: 8px; }
    .cat-tile { padding: 13px 11px; border-radius: 13px; gap: 8px; align-items: flex-start; }
    .cat-tile .ci { width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 9px; }
    .cat-tile .ci svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }
    .cat-tile .cn { font-size: 12.5px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1.1; }
    .cat-tile .cc { font-size: 10.5px; line-height: 1.25; }
    /* Toolkit: compact icon-rail rows on mobile (was 6 tall stacked cards) */
    .cap-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 9px; }
    .cap-tile { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 36px 1fr; column-gap: 13px; row-gap: 3px; align-items: start; padding: 13px 15px; border-radius: 14px; }
    .cap-tile .cap-ic { grid-row: 1 / span 2; width: 36px; height: 36px; }
    .cap-tile .cap-ic svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }
    .cap-tile h3 { grid-column: 2; margin: 0; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.2; align-self: center; }
    .cap-tile p { grid-column: 2; margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4; }

    /* How it works: numbered left-rail rows */
    .steps-grid { gap: 9px; }
    .step { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 32px 1fr; column-gap: 13px; row-gap: 2px; align-items: start; padding: 13px 15px; border-radius: 14px; }
    .step .num { grid-row: 1 / span 2; width: 32px; height: 32px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 9px; background: rgba(37,99,235,0.10); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0; }
    [data-theme="dark"] .step .num { background: rgba(96,140,240,0.16); }
    .step h3 { grid-column: 2; margin: 0; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.2; align-self: center; }
    .step p { grid-column: 2; margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4; }
    .step .price-row { grid-column: 2; margin-top: 8px; gap: 6px; }
    .step .price-pill { font-size: 11.5px; padding: 4px 10px; }

    /* Three checks: compact cards, drop decorative mocks on phones */
    .diff-grid { gap: 9px; }
    .diff-card { padding: 14px 15px; border-radius: 14px; }
    .diff-card .dnum { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
    .diff-card h3 { font-size: 15px; margin: 6px 0 5px; }
    .diff-card > p { font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; }
    .diff-mock { display: none; }

    /* Testimonials: swipeable carousel to save vertical space */
    .tcard-grid { display: flex; gap: 12px; overflow-x: auto; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; scrollbar-width: none; padding-bottom: 8px; }
    .tcard-grid::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .tcard { min-width: 85%; flex-shrink: 0; scroll-snap-align: start; padding: 16px; border-radius: 14px; }
    .tcard .quote-mark { font-size: 30px; }
    .tcard blockquote { margin: 6px 0 13px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; }
    .tcard-person img { width: 38px; height: 38px; }
    .tcard-person .pn { font-size: 13px; }
    .tcard-person .pr { font-size: 11.5px; }
    .tcard-person .stars { font-size: 12px; }

    /* Pricing: swipeable tiers to save vertical space */
    .price-grid { display: flex; gap: 12px; overflow-x: auto; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; scrollbar-width: none; padding: 14px 0 8px; }
    .price-grid::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .ptier { min-width: 80%; flex-shrink: 0; scroll-snap-align: start; padding: 18px 16px; border-radius: 16px; }
    .pt-name { font-size: 12px; }
    .pt-price { margin: 8px 0 3px; }
    .pt-price b { font-size: 30px; }
    .pt-tag { font-size: 12.5px; margin-bottom: 13px; }
    .pt-list { gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .pt-list li { font-size: 12.5px; padding-left: 25px; }

    /* Stat trio: tidy divided list, compact and aligned */
    .statline { gap: 0; margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 16px; }
    .statline .si { padding: 13px 0; }
    .statline .si + .si { border-top: 1px solid var(--border-3); }
    .statline .si .n { font-size: 20px; }
    .statline .si .l { font-size: 12.5px; margin-top: 3px; max-width: none; line-height: 1.4; }
    .ptier { padding: 20px 18px; }
    .pt-price b { font-size: 34px; }
    .pt-list li { font-size: 13px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .hero-b .header-actions .btn-ghost { display: inline-flex; }
    .hero-b .header-inner { gap: 10px; }
    .brand svg { width: 28px; height: 28px; }
    .brand b { font-size: 14px; }
    .header-actions { gap: 6px; }
    .header-actions .theme-toggle { width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 9px; }
    .header-actions .theme-toggle svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }
    .header-actions .btn-sm { padding: 7px 9px; font-size: 12px; white-space: nowrap; }
    .header-actions .su-now { display: none; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 340px) {
    .hero-b .brand b { display: none; }
  }

  /* Relocated live-feed window (moved out of hero to the page bottom) */
  .live-feed-wrap { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 30px; }
  .live-feed-wrap .section-head { margin: 0; }
  .live-feed-wrap .preview-wrap { width: 100%; max-width: 460px; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    /* Shorten the mobile view: hide decorative / redundant sections on phones */
    .band,
    .livewall,
    section[data-screen-label="B · Mission"] { display: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ================= HERO (dark) ================= -->
<section class="hero-b" data-screen-label="B · Hero">
  <header class="site-header" style="position:relative;background:transparent;backdrop-filter:none;border:none">
    <div class="wrap header-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="#">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none"><defs><linearGradient id="lg" x1="0" y1="0" x2="32" y2="32" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#2563eb"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#1e3a5f"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width="32" height="32" rx="8" fill="url(#lg)"/><path d="M8 20 Q12 10 16 16 Q20 22 23 12" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="23" cy="12" r="2.5" fill="#f97316"/><circle cx="8" cy="20" r="1.5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.5)"/></svg>
        <b>RemoteJobs<span>44</span></b>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="B Jobs.html">Browse Jobs</a>
        <a href="#">Categories</a>
        <a href="#">Companies</a>
        <a href="#">How It Works</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="header-actions">
        <button class="theme-toggle" aria-label="Toggle dark mode" aria-pressed="false">
          <svg class="i-moon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"/></svg>
          <svg class="i-sun" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.93 4.93l1.41 1.41M17.66 17.66l1.41 1.41M2 12h2M20 12h2M6.34 17.66l-1.41 1.41M19.07 4.93l-1.41 1.41"/></svg>
        </button>
        <a href="B Login.html" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Sign in</a>
        <a href="B Signup.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Sign up<span class="su-now">&nbsp;now</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="wrap hb-body">
    <div class="hb-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow-pill"><span class="dot"></span>70,000+ live remote roles · 150+ countries hiring</span>
      <h1>The world's <em>remote</em> jobs.<br>One search.<br>Apply from anywhere.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Every remote opening worth applying to &mdash; customer service, virtual assistance, marketing, data &amp; software &mdash; <b>verified remote-friendly</b> and searchable in <b>one place</b>.</p>

      <div class="hb-search" role="search">
        <svg class="s-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"/></svg>
        <input id="heroSearch" type="text" placeholder="Search 70,000+ remote jobs…" aria-label="Search jobs">
        <a href="B Jobs.html" class="btn btn-primary">Search Jobs</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hb-chips">
        <span class="lbl">Trending:</span>
        <a class="hb-chip" data-q="Engineering" href="B Jobs.html">Engineering</a>
        <a class="hb-chip" data-q="Design" href="B Jobs.html">Design</a>
        <a class="hb-chip" data-q="Data" href="B Jobs.html">Data &amp; AI</a>
        <a class="hb-chip" data-q="Marketing" href="B Jobs.html">Marketing</a>
      </div>

      <div class="hb-stats">
        <div class="hb-stat"><div class="n" data-count="70" data-suffix="k+">70k+</div><div class="l">Jobs indexed</div></div>
        <div class="hb-stat"><div class="n" data-count="150" data-suffix="+">150+</div><div class="l">Countries hiring</div></div>
        <div class="hb-stat"><div class="n" data-count="10" data-suffix="+">10+</div><div class="l">Job categories</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hb-auth">
        <a href="B Login.html" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">Sign in</a>
        <a href="B Signup.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Sign up</a>
      </div>
    </div>


  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= COMPANY MARQUEE ================= -->
<section class="band" data-screen-label="B · Companies">
  <div class="band-label">70,000+ roles from the companies defining remote work &mdash; indexed in one place</div>
  <div class="marquee" id="marquee"></div>
</section>

<!-- ================= DIFFERENTIATOR ================= -->
<section class="sec sec--tint" data-screen-label="B · Why different">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="section-kicker">How we're different</span>
      <h2>Three checks every listing passes</h2>
      <p>Most boards quietly bury roles that secretly want you on-site. Here, every job clears the same bar before it goes live.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="diff-grid">
      <div class="diff-card">
        <span class="dnum">01 · VERIFIED</span>
        <h3>Confirmed fully remote</h3>
        <p>We check each employer's location policy. Roles that secretly need relocation or a single country never make the list.</p>
        <div class="diff-mock">
          <div class="mock-row"><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span>Hires in <b>any timezone</b></div>
          <div class="mock-row"><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span>Global payroll via <b>Deel · Remote</b></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="diff-card">
        <span class="dnum">02 · REAL</span>
        <h3>Real companies, no ghost jobs</h3>
        <p>Every listing is a named company we can verify is actively hiring &mdash; no anonymous recruiters, no expired reposts left up to collect clicks.</p>
        <div class="diff-mock">
          <div class="mock-row"><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span>Posted by a <b>named company</b></div>
          <div class="mock-row"><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span>Still hiring &middot; <b>re-checked daily</b></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="diff-card">
        <span class="dnum">03 · DIRECT</span>
        <h3>Apply straight at the source</h3>
        <p>Unlock the company&rsquo;s own apply link or recruiter email and apply directly &mdash; no dead &ldquo;apply on company site&rdquo; loops or aggregator detours.</p>
        <div class="diff-mock">
          <div class="mock-row"><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span>Direct link to <b>the employer</b></div>
          <div class="mock-row mock-apply"><span>Company apply page</span><span class="mbtn">Apply &rarr;</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= BROWSE BY CATEGORY ================= -->
<section class="sec sec--tint" data-screen-label="B · Categories">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="section-kicker">Browse by category</span>
      <h2>Wherever your skills are, there's a remote role</h2>
      <p>10+ categories, updated daily. Pick a lane and jump straight into live openings.</p>
    </div>
