<!-- ================= FAQ ================= -->
<section class="sec sec--tint" data-screen-label="B · FAQ">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="section-kicker">Questions</span>
      <h2>Everything you need to know</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-grid">
      <details class="faq" open>
        <summary>Is it really free to browse?<svg class="pm" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></summary>
        <p>Yes. Search all 70,000+ roles, filter by category, level and region, and save jobs — no card required. You only pay when you're ready to unlock apply links and contact details.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>What do I get with a Day Pass vs Pro?<svg class="pm" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></summary>
        <p>The $3 Day Pass unlocks every apply link and email for 24 hours. Pro ($19/mo) adds unlimited unlocks, a saved CV to apply faster, application tracking, and early access to featured roles.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>How do you verify the jobs are really remote?<svg class="pm" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></summary>
        <p>Every listing is checked against the company's stated remote policy and hiring locations before it goes live. Roles that secretly require on-site work or one specific country are filtered out &mdash; what you see is what actually hires remotely.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>Can I get paid in my local currency?<svg class="pm" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></summary>
        <p>Most listed companies pay through global payroll partners like Deel, Remote and Wise, so you can receive USD, EUR or GBP, or convert to your local currency. Each listing notes the payment method where known.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

